[17.74904, "o", "> "]
[17.749129, "o", "1. Download the base model '\"'\"'FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base'\"'\"'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[17.749296, "o", "2. Download the LoRA adapter '\"'\"'dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection'\"'\"' \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[17.749377, "o", "3. Configure the base model with 20 language classes (not the default 2)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[17.749505, "o", "4. Save the configured model and tokenizer to '\"'\"'/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base'\"'\"'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[17.749545, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[17.749584, "o", "5. Apply the LoRA adapter to the base model\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[17.749595, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[17.749741, "o", "6. Merge the LoRA adapter with the base model and save the merged model to '\"'\"'/app/merged_model/'\"'\"'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[17.749765, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[17.74994, "o", "7. Test language detection on the following 10 test samples and save results to '\"'\"'/app/detection_results.json'\"'\"':\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[17.74997, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[17.750189, "o", "Note: The merged model will be evaluated for accuracy and must achieve at least 95% accuracy on a hidden multilingual test set (at least 75% per-language accuracy).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[17.750216, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
